+### POST /api/auth/login
+
+**Purpose:** Authenticate user with email/password
+
+**Request:**
+```typescript
+{
+  email: string;
+  password: string;
+}
+```
+
+**Response (Success):**
+```typescript
+{
+  user: {
+    id: string;
+    email: string;
+    user_metadata: {
+      name: string;
+      is_qr_superadmin: 0 | 1;
+      is_qr_admin: 0 | 1;
+      is_qr_member: 0 | 1;
