+> **Version:** 1.1.3 · **Date:** 2026-07-07 · **Status:** Active
+> **Tier:** 3 — Build Methodology · **Pairs with:** FRONTEND_BUILD_PHASE_PLAYBOOK, STARTER_KIT_HANDBOOK, COMPONENT_REGISTRY, SOFTWARE_FACTORY_PLAYBOOK, TESTING_PLAYBOOK
