+
+## 4. Sources of Truth
+- Acceptance spec:
+- Recon:
+- Data contract:
+- Relevant playbooks:
+- Engineer handoff:
+
+## 5. Environment Readiness
+- Required env:
+- Required migrations:
+- Required services:
+- Required accounts / roles:
+- Required test data:
+
+## 6. Risk Review
+- Security:
+- Privacy:
+- Data integrity:
+- Financial:
+- Tenant isolation:
+- Timing:
+- External dependencies:
+- Rollback:
+
+## 7. Acceptance Traceability
+
+| ID | Acceptance Criterion | Layer | Exact Check | Environment | Result |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+
+## 8. Regression Scope
+Existing behaviors that must remain green.
+
+## 9. Automated Checks
+Commands and expected evidence.
+
