+
+| ID | Result | Evidence | Notes |
+|---|---|---|---|
+
+## Automated Evidence
+
+| Command | Environment | Result | Evidence |
+|---|---|---|---|
+
+## Manual Evidence
+
+| Test | Result | Observation |
+|---|---|---|
+
+## Exploratory Findings
+
+| ID | Severity | Classification | Blocking? | Route |
+|---|---|---|---|---|
+
+## Pre-Existing Issues
+
+## Environment / Setup Issues
+
+## Known Risks
+
