+
+> **Version:** 1.4 · **Date:** 2026-07-08 · **Status:** Active
+> **Tier:** 5 — Design System · **Pairs with:** STARTER_KIT_HANDBOOK, COMPONENT_REGISTRY, THEMING_MANUAL, FRONTEND_BUILD_PHASE_PLAYBOOK, GLOBAL_DESIGN_SYSTEM_HANDBOOK
